 ANSWER:\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Maria's\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 reasoning\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 incorrect\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 because\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 when\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 she\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 picks\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 up\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 phone\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 at a red light, she is not just creating a physical distraction -- she is initiating a\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri3314\sl343\slmult1\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 cognitive\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 task\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 that\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 continues\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 after\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 she\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 puts\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 phone\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 down.\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Research\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 shows\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 that cognitive distraction persists for up to 27 seconds after the interrupting task ends. When the light turns green and Maria re-enters traffic, she is still processing the phone content rather than fully attending to pedestrians, cyclists, and vehicles.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri3314\sl343\slmult1\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 NHTSA data indicates texting while driving creates a 23 times higher crash risk.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 "The\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 car\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 stopped"\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 does\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 not\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 mean\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expnd