1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 speeds\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 can\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 be\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 fatal.\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 And\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 research\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 shows tailgating saves, on average, less than 2 minutes on a typical commute -- an outcome far disproportionate to the risk.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl240\slmult1\sb157\f3\fs18\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf2 PAGE REFERENCE: Module 3 / Section 3.1; Module 3 / Section 3.2; Module 8 / Section \expnd-1\expndtw-5 8.2\par
