krule\li57\ri2636\sl343\slmult1\sb169\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 MODEL\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 ANSWER:\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 Sarah\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 exhibiting\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 multiple\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 warning\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 signs\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 dangerous\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 fatigue:\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 heavy eyes and missing an exit are direct indicators that her brain is beginning to enter\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery1441\footery464\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl240\slmult1\sb208\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 microsleep -- brief involuntary sleep episodes lasting 2 to 30 seconds that \expnd0\expndtw-2 occur\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri3075\sl343\slmult1\sb93\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 without\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 conscious\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 awareness.\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 Research\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 shows\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 that\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 driving\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 after\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 20\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 hours\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 without\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 sleep produces impairment equivalent to a blood alcohol content of 0.08% -- the legal DUI limit in Florida. The belief that she will "be fine" is itself a symptom of fatigue-\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri3075\sl343\slmult1\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 impaired\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 judgment;\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 severely\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 fatigued\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 drivers\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 routinely\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 overestimate\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 their\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 remaining capacity. Rolling down the window and turning up the radio delay the problem for minutes, not the hour she needs. The only safe solution is to pull into the next\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri3589\sl343\slmult1\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 rest\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 area,\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 recline\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 seat,\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 sleep\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 for\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 20\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 to\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 30\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 minutes.\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Arriving\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 one\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 hour\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 later is categorically better than the alternative.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl240\slmult1\sb157\f3\fs18\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf2 PAGE REFERENCE: Module 7 / Section 7.3; Module 9 / Section 9.2 (Scenario \expnd-1\expndtw-5 5)\par
