\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f3\fs17\b0\i1\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb111\f3\fs18\b0\i1\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl240\slmult1\sb1\f1\fs18\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 SCENARIO \expnd-1\expndtw-5 10\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri3480\sl343\slmult1\sb155\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Michael\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 has\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 been\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 drinking\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 at\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 party.\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 He\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 has\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 had\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 four\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 beers\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 over\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 3\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 hours.\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 He\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 feels "mostly fine" and decides to drive home because it is only 3 miles. Explain the specific ways alcohol has already impaired his ability to drive, and describe what he should do instead.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri3189\sl343\slmult1\sb167\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 KEY\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 ELEMENTS:\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 impairment\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 begins\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 before\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 0.08%;\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 judgment\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 first\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 affected;\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 4\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 beers in 3 hours can produce 0.06-0.10% BAC depending on weight; vision, reaction time; alternatives (rideshare, designated driver, calling a friend).\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri2929\sl343\slmult1\sb169\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 MODEL\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 ANSWER:\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Michael's\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 belief\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 that\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 he\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 "mostly\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 fine"\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 produced\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 by\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 alcohol\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 itself\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 --alcohol's first effect is on judgment and self-assessment, which means impaired drivers are uniquely unable to accurately judge their own impairment. At approximately 4 beers\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri2636\sl343\slmult1\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 in\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 3\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 hours,\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 depending\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 on\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 his\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 body\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 weight,\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Michael's\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 BAC\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 may\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 already\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 exceed\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 or\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 approach the 0.08% legal limit in Florida -- but impairment begins significantly before that limit.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri3075\sl343\slmult1\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 His peripheral vision is reduced, his reaction time is slower than he perceives, and his ability to track multiple hazards simultaneously is compromised. The 3-mile distance is irrelevant -- the vast majority of DUI crashes occur within 5 miles of home. Michael's options\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 include:\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 calling\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 rideshare\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 service,\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 calling\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 friend\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 or\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 family\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 member,\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 arranging a designated driver, or staying at the location until fully sober. No appointment, no embarrassment, and no inconvenience is worth the consequences of a DUI crash.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl240\slmult1\sb155\f3\fs18\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf2 PAGE REFERENCE: Module 5 (BDI course content, incorporated by \expnd0\expndtw-2 reference)\par
