\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f3\fs17\b0\i1\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb111\f3\fs18\b0\i1\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl240\slmult1\sb1\f1\fs18\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 SCENARIO \expnd-1\expndtw-5 11\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri3120\sl343\slmult1\sb155\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Before driving, a student in this ADI course is asked to write an implementation intention\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 for\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 their\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 most\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 common\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 risky\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 driving\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 behavior.\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Explain\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 what\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 an\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 implementation intention is, why it is more effective than simple willpower, and write an example for\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl-217\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 a driver whose primary risk behavior is speeding when running \expnd0\expndtw-2 late.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb44\f2\fs19\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri2929\sl343\slmult1\sb1\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 KEY\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 ELEMENTS:\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 define\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 implementation\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 intention\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 (if-then\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 structure);\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 cite\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 Gollwitzer's research; explain willpower is unreliable; provide an actual if-then example.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl240\slmult1\sb169\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 MODEL ANSWER: An implementation intention is a specific "if-then" behavioral plan \expnd-1\expndtw-4 made\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery1441\footery464\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri2929\sl343\slmult1\sb208\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 in advance, with the format: "If [situation], then I will [behavior]." Research by Peter Gollwitzer\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 at\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 NYU\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 found\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 that\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 writing\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 single\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 implementation\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 intention\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 more\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 than\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 doubles the likelihood of following through on intended behavior change. This is more effective than relying on willpower because willpower is finite -- under stress, time pressure, or fatigue, it depletes quickly. The implementation intention bypasses willpower by\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl-216\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 pre-binding future behavior to a specific trigger, before the emotional pressure \expnd0\expndtw-2 arrives.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri2783\sl343\slmult1\sb93\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 An\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 example\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 for\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 driver\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 who\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 speeds\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 when\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 running\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 late:\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 "If\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 I\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 find\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 myself\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 running\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 more\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 than 10 minutes late for an appointment, then I will call or text ahead to say I am running\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri2929\sl343\slmult1\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 late,\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 accept\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 consequences,\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 drive\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 at\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 or\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 below\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 speed\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 limit."\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 This\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 decision\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 is made at home, calmly, not at 70 mph on I-95.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl240\slmult1\sb160\f3\fs18\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\cf2 PAGE REFERENCE: Module 8 / Section \expnd-1\expndtw-5 8.3\par
