\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 upon\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 publication\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 of significant new research that contradicts course content.\par\pard\plain\s3\ls24\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li257\fi-200\sl240\slmult1\sb175\tx257\f1\fs18\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 CURRICULUM \expnd0\expndtw-2 REVIEW:\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl240\slmult1\sb155\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 The full ADI curriculum will be reviewed annually and updated \expnd0\expndtw-2 whenever:\par\pard\plain\s3\ls24\ilvl1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li710\fi-200\sl240\slmult1\sb86\tx710\f2\fs18\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Florida Statutes or Florida Administrative Code relevant to ADI are \expnd0\expndtw-2 amended.\par\pard\plain\s3\ls24\ilvl1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li710\fi-200\sl240\slmult1\sb76\tx710\f2\fs18\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 FLHSMV issues new \expnd0\expndtw-2 guidance.\par\pard\plain\s3\ls24\ilvl1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li700\fi-190\sl240\slmult1\sb77\tx700\f2\fs18\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 New Florida traffic fatality statistics are \expnd0\expndtw-2 published.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb53\f2\fs18\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\ls24\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li257\fi-200\sl240\slmult1\tx257\f1\fs18\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 STUDENT \expnd0\expndtw-2 RECORDS:\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri2929\sl343\slmult1\sb156\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Student\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 enrollment,\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 session\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 logs,\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 progress,\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 essay\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 responses,\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 exam\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 scores,\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 and completion certificates are retained electronical