\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb107\f2\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb156\f2\fs19\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\sl240\slmult1\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 I, Jordan Lovelace, Course Director of Quick Pass Traffic School, certify \expnd0\expndtw-2 that:\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb45\f2\fs19\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\ls25\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri2677\sl343\slmult1\tx268\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 The ADI course curriculum contained in this document is Florida-specific and is designed to meet all requirements of Section 318.1451(4), Florida Statutes and Chapter 15A-8, \expnd0\expndtw-2 F.A.C.\par\pard\plain\s3\ls25\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li268\fi-211\sl240\slmult1\sb169\tx268\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 The course contains a minimum of 12 hours of content, enforced by server-side time \expnd0\expndtw-2 limits.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb45\f2\fs19\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\ls25\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li268\fi-211\sl240\slmult1\tx268\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Maximum course access is limited to 6 hours per 24-hour period per ADI \expnd0\expndtw-2 requirements.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb44\f2\fs19\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\ls25\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li268\fi-211\sl240\slmult1\sb1\tx268\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Maximum timed breaks per session are limited to 90 minutes per ADI \expnd0\expndtw-2 requirements.\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery1441\footery464\pard\plain\s3\ls25\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li268\fi-211\sl240\slmult1\sb208\tx268\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Student feedback is provided before the second session \expnd0\expndtw-2 begins.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb44\f2\fs19\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\ls25\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li268\fi-211\sl240\slmult1\sb1\tx268\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 A minimum of one interactive exercise per subject area is included (11 \expnd0\expndtw-2 total).\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb44\f2\fs19\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\ls25\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li268\fi-211\sl240\slmult1\tx268\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Subject matter video content does not exceed 2 \expnd0\expndtw-2 hours.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb45\f2\fs19\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\ls25\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li57\ri2740\sl343\slmult1\tx268\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 The\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 50-scenario\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 short\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 essay\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 bank\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 includes\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 model\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 answers\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 page\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 references\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 for\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 each scenario. The 10-question final examination draws randomly from this bank.\par\pard\plain\s3\ls25\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li268\fi-211\sl240\slmult1\sb169\tx268\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 All statistics cited are from the most recently available data \expnd0\expndtw-2 sources.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb45\f2\fs19\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\ls25\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li373\fi-316\sl240\slmult1\tx373\f2\fs19\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 This document represents the complete resubmission responsive to the \expnd0\expndtw-2 Department's\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li510\sl240\slmult1\sb86\f2\fs18\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 review dated April 27, 2026 (refere